bound-lock/1 about="Native quartet: the declared CLI consumer verifies the authenticated carrier through the existing host ports on two formed places. Exact provider bytes are laid by digest; formation and image preparation are separate acts. The native reader measures failures with its declared fixture image. This demand does not certify the final archive, other-machine portability or current-answer reuse." at=witness:authenticated-reference-native-quartet-demand by=target form=interval measure=count needs=docs/contracts/reference-profile.md|samples/authenticated-reference/yes.json|samples/authenticated-reference/no.json|vectors/native/authenticated-reference.vector.json|vectors/native/authenticated-reference-formation.vector.json|vectors/native/authenticated-reference.cli.json role=demands scope=release/contracts/authenticated-reference value=0..0
